din</surname><given-names>CW</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Episodic luteinizing hormone secretion in man. Pulse analysis, clinical interpretation, physiologic mechanisms</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1973</year><volume>52</volume><fpage>2617</fpage><lpage>2628</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">4729055</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1172/JCI107454</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>